		(descr "Resonant bank film capacitor, dual-pitch 2-pin radial (native-21 stage 51, DECISIONS 73): one RES_A-side pad 1 at 0 and two pad-2 holes, at 22.5 mm (TDK B32643H8104J000, fitted from stage 52 for the prototype lot; TDK B32643B8104J000, the 28 A part) and at 27.5 mm (KNSCHA MMK104J3DF1KN208G2, fitted at stage 51, now the in-stock fallback). The two pad-2 holes share the number, so both are on the SW_B net and the unused one stays open (plated, no lead). KNSCHA (27.5 mm hole): MMKP82 104J2000V P=27.5, spec KNS20200505002 (LCSC C528962, sha256 4621763054ad5e92...) p.3 dimensions: W 31.5 +-0.5, H 19.5 +-0.5, T 11 +-0.5, P 27.5 +-0.5, d 0.8 +-0.05 mm; body at its maximum 32 x 11.5 x 20 mm, centred on the 27.5 mm pitch (x -2.25 .. 29.75). TDK (22.5 mm hole): B3264*B data sheet (6/26, sha256 ab9fdca0...4a58ab77) p.2 e 22.5 +-0.4 mm, d1 0.8 +-0.05 mm; p.11 maximum body 14.5 x 29.5 x 26.5 mm, centred on the 22.5 mm pitch (x -2.0 .. 24.5). Drill 1.2 mm for the 0.8 mm leads of both parts (0.85 mm max lead; JLC PTH drill tolerance +0.13 / -0.08 mm leaves >= 0.27 mm diametral clearance); pad 2.4 mm, annular ring 0.6 mm against JLC's 'PTH annular ring, Multilayer 2 oz' >= 0.254 mm (FAB-JLCPCB.md). F.Fab: both maximum bodies. F.SilkS and F.CrtYd: one rectangle around the union (courtyard 0.5 mm beyond it along X, 0.2 mm across, as the stage-49 bank, which stacks at 15.0 mm pitch). Origin at pin 1. Pad 1 is round like pad 2 (neither part has polarity): a square pad 1 corner of the row-5 cap came 8.035 mm (plan view) from the In1 v3v3 plane corner at (159.9, 122.2) on stage 49, under the 8.047 mm HOT-SELV minimum; round, 8.325 mm. 3D model (stage 52, DECISIONS 74): the fitted part is TDK B32643H8104J000 in the 22.5 mm hole (B3264*H June 2026, sha256 69b56e62..., p.3 e 22.5 +-0.4, d1 0.8 +-0.05; p.14 maximum body 14.5 x 29.5 x 26.5 mm, the B32643B body), so the model is models3d/capacitors/TDK_B32643B8104J000.step (maximum body centred on the 22.5 mm pitch, x -2.0 .. 24.5); the KNSCHA fallback's model is models3d/capacitors/KNSCHA_MMK104J3DF1KN208G2.step (same origin, swap the model path to view it). Stage 51 fitted KNSCHA in the 27.5 mm hole.")
		(tags "film capacitor MMKP radial dual pitch KNSCHA MMKP82 TDK B32643B P22.5 P27.5")
